flowchart LR
  Files[PDF / DOCX / CSV / TXT / MD] --> Parser[Validated extraction]
  Parser --> Docs[(documents)]
  Question[Question] --> Retrieval[Cross-language retrieval / local fallback]
  Docs --> Retrieval
  Retrieval --> Answer[Answer with sources]
  Answer --> Chat[(chat_history)]
  Docs --> Stats[GET /analytics]
  Chat --> Stats
  Stats --> Charts[Live chart dashboard]
  Charts --> Lang[Language counts]
  Charts --> Daily[Daily questions]
  Charts --> Category[Categories / answer modes]
